#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:3
#: 95c1c5be3e664c3081c5b69709eaf015
msgid "几何过滤（Geometry Filter）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:5
#: e0bd3312c5794597bf5512b5d5c1fb63
msgid "`Group`: `Filter` | `Class`: `GeometryFilterCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:7
#: 628c06bcb8a149bea72e1e297839375f
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:9
#: 6da108daee4b4997be79e6057617acfc
msgid ""
"`Geometry Filter` 按显式阈值过滤候选结构：最短原子间距、单原子体积、质量密度和有限晶胞。它不计算能量，不修复结构，也不替代 "
"`FPS Filter`。它的职责是在代表性采样和 DFT 前挡掉几何上已经明显不可用的结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:11
#: 0153b37716ed4dd2b9c6196f1bfe19dd
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:13
#: c24eb4537ab548d09f76cf5d07057a06
msgid "场景：随机占位和强扰动后出现短键结构"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:15
#: 60edfb7298f14e79be35fd671d92f3fe
msgid ""
"合金候选池经过 `Random Occupancy → Atomic Perturb` 后，少量结构出现 < 1.0 Å 的原子重叠。它们进入 "
"DFT 会浪费队列，进入 FPS 会污染 descriptor 空间。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:17
#: 9ea7fdcee7af489f9fd2bf5befa0b849
msgid ""
"**输入：** 已生成的候选结构池。 **目标：** 在 FPS 前删除短键和异常体积结构。 **参数设置：** "
"`min_pair_distance=1.2`，`min_volume_per_atom=5.0`，`max_volume_per_atom=40.0`，密度阈值保持关闭。"
" **输出：** 只保留满足所有开启阈值的结构。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 导入 `NEP Dataset Display` "
"后，最短键分布不再有低端离群点；FPS 选出的结构不应再包含明显重叠帧。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:23
#: 85bae7a30cb647bebf57bd9c9460640e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:24
#: 7fb1cfac4d034e0899470e0643a159f5
msgid "Min Pair Distance（min_pair_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:25
#: 55d9624b7aac4e5593b1aaa77d74ea47
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 1.0 "
"Å。任意原子对允许的最近距离，硬短键门槛。应低于你目标体系的正常最近邻键长，但远高于原子明显重叠的距离——金属/氧化物通常从 1.0~1.5 Å "
"起步。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:27
#: 49c6f58cec7a458abf56834943ad8f7b
msgid "Min Volume Per Atom（min_volume_per_atom）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:28
#: f8922956c53b4b41ad042d8f13c0803e
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。允许的最小单原子体积，过滤过度压缩的结构。阈值应来自同材料平衡体积的下界。多孔、slab "
"或含真空的体系不要随便打开，开了反而误删合理结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:30
#: b2a16fec2cd64e79873d80292623782f
msgid "Max Volume Per Atom（max_volume_per_atom）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:31
#: 83ec5a85001f40638511a1c768685061
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。允许的最大单原子体积，过滤过度拉伸或异常大 "
"cell。体相候选池可以设一个合理上界；slab/分子体系有真空时这个阈值容易误杀。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:33
#: 91af640bf3324022af76b8b78cdf6c7f
msgid "Min Density（min_density）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:34
#: c55d9eb3c12944609d0c30b3c5426717
msgid "`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。按质量密度过滤低密度异常结构。只在体相或近体相候选池打开；含真空、孔洞或表面模型应保持 0。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:36
#: 227b8ff6bd0f4af4a2e3321cdd9d9136
msgid "Max Density（max_density）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:37
#: 72e6ceba850347f4ae0a9734145d45ea
msgid "`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。按质量密度过滤过度压缩的结构。阈值应参考该材料的真实密度上界，不要跨元素体系套同一个数字。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:39
#: 35ac774892f148c8b33378f995c159b3
msgid "Require Finite Cell（require_finite_cell）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:40
#: 294ed39217ba4ad292e8c9e7f7da2ad4
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后零体积 cell 的结构直接删除。晶体、slab、界面候选池建议开；孤立分子或非周期构型关掉。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:42
#: 6b7bac38f0214be3b70d6115560bcc45
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:44
#: 0e9dd35b391a4bc0a8185264682d79ce
msgid "短键门槛"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:46
#: ce39ddae7b0242e28f30faae7ae174c9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"GeometryFilterCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"min_pair_distance\": 1.2,\n"
"    \"min_volume_per_atom\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"max_volume_per_atom\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"min_density\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"max_density\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"require_finite_cell\": false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:60
#: 41b079b5ad454456b646f01ea7f6f331
msgid "用于随机扰动、插入缺陷或随机占位后的第一道硬检查。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:62
#: 8b72a3a9a49e499181765426432acb9c
msgid "晶体候选池清洗"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:64
#: ab3d2f4a9b71404a938a697803fc8dfa
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"GeometryFilterCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"min_pair_distance\": 1.1,\n"
"    \"min_volume_per_atom\": 5.0,\n"
"    \"max_volume_per_atom\": 60.0,\n"
"    \"min_density\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"max_density\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"require_finite_cell\": true\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:78
#: 8879df4e5ea2462d94ad23dfbea790a8
msgid "用于晶体、缺陷和表面候选池，防止零体积或极端体积结构进入后续流程。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:80
#: dd4b8cf1894542a8bf5a5a789d8ee805
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:82
#: 8f02997e50824b748066d711508340fe
msgid "`Atomic Perturb → Geometry Filter → FPS Filter`：先生成位移扰动，再删除短键，最后做代表性采样。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:83
#: ac35b8b3d53c493494c769addb79e4f9
msgid "`Random Occupancy → Geometry Filter → FPS Filter`：合金占位后先做几何门槛，再选代表结构去 DFT。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:84
#: aebb28cb735543148a585e82d9da2ae5
msgid "`Random Slab → Insert Defect → Geometry Filter`：表面插入后检查吸附物和基底是否重叠。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:86
#: 521a77343a6d48368e0e27834a0e1693
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:88
#: 5da740ebae2d4954929151c54ee60a09
msgid "**输出为空。** 至少一个阈值过严。先看最短键和体积分布，确认阈值是否超出了当前体系的真实范围。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:90
#: 10f7a9cbd09c40c2b1a88a8a17649454
msgid ""
"**密度阈值不生效。** `min_density=0.0` 和 `max_density=0.0` 都表示关闭密度检查。只有大于 0 "
"的阈值参与判定。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:92
#: 8d7fd4674a374f17ac9ac7ab098db2e4
msgid ""
"**非周期分子被删掉。** 如果开启了体积、密度或 `require_finite_cell`，零体积分子会被删除。分子构象清洗通常只开 "
"`min_pair_distance`。"
msgstr ""

